      <title>Thank you for attending</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">53105016</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/32a5178</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none; background-color: #00539b;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="padding: 0px;">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2022/02/5531078/cwc-columbuscommitment-banner_original.jpg" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Woman applauding. Text: The Columbus Committment: Achieving pay equity" width="600" height="300">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Thank you for attending the Columbus Commitment Onboarding Webinar hosted by the <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/womenscommission/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Columbus Women’s Commission</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We are excited to partner with your organization to advance pay equity in our community!</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">The conversation does not end here. Our goal is to dismantle barriers and reduce gender and race-based inequities to improve the economic position of women in our community.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">If you have questions on how to get started, or would like to schedule a meeting to discuss the Columbus Commitment, please email Christina Ratleff at <a href="mailto:CLRatleff@columbus.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">CLRatleff@columbus.gov</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We encourage you to take the following 4 steps to advance this critical work.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>1. Share your learnings with your colleagues and invite them to join the conversation</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Share your learnings and your commitment to the women of Columbus on all social media platforms. Invite company leaders in your network to sign the Columbus Commitment Pay Equity Pledge.</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2022/08/30/file_attachments/2256736/Columbus%20Commitment%20Adopter%20Onboarding%20Packet_2022.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Columbus Commitment Onboarding Packet</a></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;"><a href="https://www.columbus.gov/payequity/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Columbus Commitment Pay Equity Pledge website</a></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;"><a href="https://youtu.be/IOctRlJMvZ4?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Recording of the presentation</a></li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2022/08/30/file_attachments/2256713/CWC%20Onboarding%20Webinar%20_Master.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Presentation slides</a></li>
</ul>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>2. Learn how to implement strong gender-informed paid leave company policies</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Employers and executives can be leaders in implementing paid leave polices in their workplaces.</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">
<a href="https://paidleave.us/workshop/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Click here</a> for resources on how to create or expand paid leave policies at your company</li>
</ul>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>3. Stay connected!</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">We are on this journey together. Make sure to <a href="https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/subscriber/new/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">subscribe to our newsletter</a> to stay up to date on resources, relevant news about gender and racial equity in the workplace, and Columbus Commitment learning events.</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">The Women’s Commission is also on social media! Follow us on <a href="https://twitter.com/cbuswomen?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Twitter</a>, like us on <a href="https://www.facebook.com/CBUSWomen/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Facebook</a>, and join our <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/columbus-women-s-commission?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">LinkedIn network</a> to stay up to date.</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left"><strong>4. Share your feedback</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Please complete a <a href="https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/RTLBPS3?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">1-minute survey</a> on the webinar. Findings will inform future speakers and topics.</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Thank you for your commitment to gender and pay equity!</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"> </p>
